**/bin/**
!**/bin/**/
!layaProject/bin/index.html
release/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
publish/
# LayaAir IDE script upgrade archive (auto-migrated old versions)
**/.laya/_pub_old/
.rpt2_cache/
